            </div>
            <div class="cs-row">
              <div class="cs-label mono">Approach</div>
              <p>Push the mechanical checking to rules, not a model. Five deterministic checks run in parallel over every row before any AI is involved, so the flags are reproducible and explainable on their own.</p>
            </div>
