            <div class="cs-row">
              <div class="cs-label mono">Approach</div>
              <p>The five check outputs merge into one summary per row, then pass through a Basic LLM Chain node (GPT-4o, temperature 0.2) that writes a plain-language explanation for each flag and attaches a confidence score, rather than a raw pass/fail code a reader has to interpret.</p>
            </div>
